      "body": "# Spark Words\n一款简洁优雅的英语首字母填空练习工具，沉浸式练习，融合AI助力学习。\nGithub：[https://github.com/Mystic-Stars/Spark-Words](https://github.com/Mystic-Stars/Spark-Words)\nDemo：[https://spark.ghs.red](https://spark.ghs.red)\n## 特性\n- 极简设计：完全无干扰的设计，流畅而现代化。\n- AI 驱动：深度融合AI体验，支持API和手动导入多种方式导入试卷。\n- 社区题库：提供在线题库，鼓励大家共创。\n## 截图预览\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"735\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92239672-a3cd-4453-be93-2aa647e2b51d\" />\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87b99e0b-e4a1-4614-b4f7-9ab1bed4b44f\" />\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"729\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7fc0bd2-545d-48af-8cf8-254b5a1c76a7\" />\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"728\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05e6a3d2-3ba6-410b-8a8a-0f285a5cf398\" />\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"726\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2cbbf4d3-e234-416b-81d3-72ad1ac687f1\" />\n",
